WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Each monitor has four fixed workspace faces

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hold Ctrl + Alt + left mouse and drag to rotate

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Rotate to another face; top and bottom are decorative

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The + button is unavailable while Cube is enabled

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Release to select the nearest face; Escape cancels

